As an AI Security Specialist you will influence how applications and AI-enabled solutions are designed, assessed and governed-turning complex security standards into practical guidance that enables innovation while protecting our global business.
 You will combine hands-on security assessment with consulting, governance and cross-functional collaboration:
 Evaluate, review and approve AI-enabled, client, mobile, add-in, web and other applications;
 Assess solution, product and architecture documentation for security risks and compliance;
 Review security checklists, document outcomes and […] requirements to technical and non-technical stakeholders;
 Experience collaborating in international, cross-functional teams and influencing decisions without direct authority;
 Advanced English skills (verbal and written).
Our Offer:
 Integration in a challenging and international work environment;
 Flexible working model;
 Collaborative working style;
 Continuous opportunities for the promotion of talent and training;
 Opportunity to make a difference.
 We are committed to fostering a workplace where everyone feels safe, respected, and valued. All kind of applications are welcome.
